  "limits": "No canonical before-inode snapshot, so exact before/after byte change is not asserted. Normal G-BOOT1 routes through root cwd and may avoid this mismatch, but the public observer's read-only contract does not restrict selected root to cwd.",
  "next": "Parent obtaining required AGY advice before substantive fix/acceptance. Safe regression must use two private repositories for differing startup cwd and selected root. All further observer/JJ execution paused.",
